      "deleted_file": false,
      "generated_file": false
    },
    {
      "diff": "@@ -1356,7 +1356,7 @@ your `~/.rpmmacros` file to enable parallel builds:\n Building the RPM package requires quite a few packages and libraries\n including GLib, `gcc`, `flex`, Asciidoctor, and Qt development\n tools such as `uic` and `moc`. The required Qt packages can usually be\n-obtained by installing the _qt5-devel_ package. For a complete list of\n+obtained by installing the _qt6-qt*-devel_ packages. For a complete list of\n build requirements, look for the “BuildRequires” lines in\n _packaging/rpm/wireshark.spec.in_.\n \n",
      "collapsed": false,
      "too_large": false,
      "new_path": "doc/wsdg_src/wsdg_sources.adoc",
      "old_path": "doc/wsdg_src/wsdg_sources.adoc",
